# id | world | patch | env | expect | params
# Row 1: normal world → one unbound sprout (#90), #91 bound (no report), #92 standalone (no report)
normal|normal|||one-unbound|
# Row 2: probe-fail — openall is unreadable (garbage) → PROBE-FAIL line, no unbound report
probe-fail|normal||IN_OPENALL=garbage|probe-fail|
# Row 3: cue-below — human-authored issue #93 has "Harvested from #89" on line 3 (not line 1)
# → cue regex with \A does NOT match, so no unbound report for #93 (only #90 still matches)
cue-below|normal|gh/issue-list.json @ add-cue-below.jq||one-unbound|
# Row 4: cue-at-head — human-authored issue #94 has "Harvested from #89" on line 1 (true head)
# → cue regex with \A DOES match, so #94 appears as UNBOUND SPROUT (cue: Harvested from)
cue-at-head|normal|gh/issue-list.json @ add-cue-at-head.jq||cue-at-head|
